@baseUrl = http://localhost:3100
@token = training-demo-token

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Swagger JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### Login dummy
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"trainer","password":"training123"}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/inspections?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search dan filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/inspections?q=PMP&condition=needs_action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/inspections/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create valid + idempotency
POST {{baseUrl}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"assetCode":"PMP-099","location":"Workshop B","condition":"needs_action","note":"Motor bergetar tinggi"}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/inspections/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assetCode":"PMP-001-REV","location":"Workshop C","condition":"needs_action","note":"Seal pompa perlu dijadwalkan ulang"}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/inspections/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validation error 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assetCode":"PMP-099","location":"Workshop B","condition":"needs_action","note":"pendek"}

### Session expired 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Fault 500 — ENABLE_FAULTS harus true
GET {{baseUrl}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Debug-Fault: list-500

### Delay 11 detik — untuk timeout Flutter
GET {{baseUrl}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Debug-Delay-Ms: 11000
